# Kept out of every image (and out of the build context, so builds stay fast).
# The dev setup mounts the source at run time, so nothing here is hidden from development.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
.pnpm-store
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.DS_Store

# Secrets never enter an image; pass them at run time (env_file / --env-file).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

*.md
!apps/web/**/*.md
